            <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#ffffff;" data-i18n="testi_title">Biz haqimizda <span>nima deyishadi?</span></h2>
        </div>
        
        <div class="testimonials-grid">
            <div class="testimonial-card reveal-up delay-1">
                <div class="testimonial-stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
                <p class="testimonial-text" data-i18n="testi_1_text">"Farzandimiz Al-Khorazmiy maktabiga qatnagandan beri matematika va ingliz tilida ajoyib natijalar ko'rsatmoqda. Muallimlarning e'tibori va zamonaviy yondashuvidan juda mamnunmiz!"</p>
                <div class="testimonial-author">
                    <div class="author-avatar">NX</div>
                    <div class="author-info">
