            <div class="testimonial-card reveal-up delay-3">
                <div class="testimonial-stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star-half-alt"></i></div>
                <p class="testimonial-text" data-i18n="testi_3_text">"O'g'lim robotika va IT yo'nalishida 1-o'rinni oldi. Chet ellik ustozlar bilan erkin inglizcha gaplashayotganini ko'rib, to'g'ri tanlov qilganimizga yana bir bor amin bo'ldim."</p>
                <div class="testimonial-author">
